	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r01r0101_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あの　でんこうけいじばん
ずっと　まっくろ　なんですよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:33:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あの　電光掲示板
ずっと　真っ黒　なんですよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:33:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:29:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>INFOMATIONW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r01r0101_backpackerm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あちこち　たびをして　わかったのは
うまれこきょうも　いいってこと……！▽
とびだしたくて　しかたなかったのにな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:38:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:38:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あちこち　旅をして　わかったのは
生まれ故郷も　いいってこと……！▽
飛びだしたくて　仕方なかったのにな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:38:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:38:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:33:44" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BACKPACKERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:33:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r01r0101_trainerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしの　ポケモンたち
とにかく　しょうぶが　すきすぎて……▼
あたし　クタクタ……　で
ここで　ひとやすみ　してるの……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:55:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:55:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしの　ポケモンたち
とにかく　勝負が　好きすぎて……▼
あたし　クタクタ……　で
ここで　一休み　してるの……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:55:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:55:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:38:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T05:43:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
</MessageStudioText>